<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>God’s loving seekers can receive</l><l>The water in God’s Word;</l><l>As we are watered in the Word</l><l>God’s person is absorbed.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>God’s loving seekers, in the Word,</l><l>Receive the Spirit’s breath;</l><l>When we inhale the living Word</l><l>We exhale sin and death.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>God’s loving seekers will enjoy</l><l>Great blessing rich and full;</l><l>God as the Author is conveyed,</l><l>Our portion, wonderful.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
